  "releaseNotes": "Release notes for 10.1.1:\n\t\t- Fixed: Line(level, message) wrote at the scope's level instead of the line's, so E/W/I lines reached the provider as TRACE;\n\t\t- Fixed: E(exception) logs exception.ToString(), so inner exceptions are no longer dropped;\n\t\tRelease notes for 10.1.0:\n\t\t- Message Templates: now LogScope supports Serilog-style structured message templates\n\t\tRelease notes for 10.0.0:\n\t\t- Initial release with .NET10 support",
